{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cognix-resources-api-v1",
    "name": "CognIX AI — Resources API",
    "description": "File & Document Repository endpoints for CognIX AI.\n\n**Authentication:** All requests require a Bearer JWT token. Set `access_token` in the collection variables after logging in.\n\n**Base URL:** Set `base_url` to your environment (e.g. `http://localhost:3000` for local, or your deployed API URL).\n\n**Quick start:**\n1. Set `base_url` and `access_token` in collection variables.\n2. Run **Create Resource (Upload File)** — the `resource_id` variable is auto-set from the response.\n3. Use that `resource_id` in Get, Update, and Delete requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API base URL. Change to your deployed URL for staging/production."
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT access token. Obtain from the Auth / Login endpoint."
    },
    {
      "key": "resource_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auto-populated by the Create Resource request test script."
    },
    {
      "key": "field_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of the field to scope resources to. Optional on most requests."
    },
    {
      "key": "conversation_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID of a conversation to tag resources to, or to list tagged resources for."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create Resource (Upload File)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('resource_id', body.id);",
              "  pm.test('Resource created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(201));",
              "  pm.test('Has id', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string'));",
              "  pm.test('isProcessed is false', () => pm.expect(body.isProcessed).to.equal(false));",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "type",
              "value": "document",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "Required. One of: document, textbook, image, audio, video, link"
            },
            {
              "key": "title",
              "value": "Lecture Notes Week 3",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "Required."
            },
            {
              "key": "description",
              "value": "Covers chapters 5–7",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "Optional."
            },
            {
              "key": "fieldId",
              "value": "{{field_id}}",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "Optional. UUID of the field to attach this resource to."
            },
            {
              "key": "conversationIds",
              "value": "[\"{{conversation_id}}\"]",
              "type": "text",
              "description": "Optional. JSON array string of conversation UUIDs to tag this resource to — it will then appear under each of those conversations and feed into the AI's context there."
            },
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": [],
              "description": "Required for all types except 'link'. Max 50 MB. Accepted formats per type — document: pdf, docx, xlsx, pptx, txt, csv | image: jpg, png, gif, webp, svg | audio: mp3, wav, ogg, aac, flac | video: mp4, webm, mov, avi."
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"]
        },
        "description": "Uploads a file and creates a new resource record.\n\nThe `file` field must be included for all types except `link`. File is validated against a MIME-type whitelist before upload.\n\n**Accepted MIME types by resource type:**\n- `document`: application/pdf, application/msword, .docx, .xlsx, .pptx, text/plain, text/csv\n- `textbook`: application/pdf, application/msword, .docx, text/plain\n- `image`: image/jpeg, image/png, image/gif, image/webp, image/svg+xml\n- `audio`: audio/mpeg, audio/wav, audio/ogg, audio/mp4, audio/aac, audio/flac\n- `video`: video/mp4, video/mpeg, video/webm, video/quicktime, video/x-msvideo\n- `link`: no file — use `externalUrl` instead\n\n**Max file size:** 50 MB\n\n`conversationIds` must belong to the authenticated user — a 400 is returned listing any that don't resolve."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "201 Created — Document uploaded",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "type", "value": "document", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "title", "value": "Lecture Notes Week 3", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Covers chapters 5–7", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "conversationIds", "value": "[\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"]", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"]
            }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"type\": \"document\",\n  \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3\",\n  \"description\": \"Covers chapters 5\\u20137\",\n  \"fieldId\": null,\n  \"fileUrl\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/cognix/raw/upload/v1714900000/cognix/resources/1714900000-lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileName\": \"lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileSize\": 204800,\n  \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"externalUrl\": null,\n  \"isProcessed\": false,\n  \"conversationIds\": [\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"],\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "400 Bad Request — File too large",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"] }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": \"File is too large. Maximum allowed size is 50 MB.\",\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "400 Bad Request — Unsupported MIME type",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"] }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": \"Unsupported file type \\\"application/zip\\\" for resource type \\\"document\\\". Allowed: application/pdf, application/msword, ...\",\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Resource (External Link)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('resource_id', body.id);",
              "  pm.test('Link resource created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(201));",
              "  pm.test('externalUrl present', () => pm.expect(body.externalUrl).to.be.a('string'));",
              "  pm.test('fileUrl is null', () => pm.expect(body.fileUrl).to.be.null);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            { "key": "type", "value": "link", "type": "text", "description": "Must be 'link' for external URL resources." },
            { "key": "title", "value": "Khan Academy — Kinematics", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "externalUrl", "value": "https://www.khanacademy.org/science/physics/one-dimensional-motion", "type": "text", "description": "Required for type=link. Must be a valid URL." },
            { "key": "fieldId", "value": "{{field_id}}", "type": "text", "description": "Optional." },
            { "key": "conversationIds", "value": "[\"{{conversation_id}}\"]", "type": "text", "description": "Optional. JSON array string of conversation UUIDs to tag this resource to." }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"]
        },
        "description": "Creates a resource that points to an external URL. No file upload is required. `externalUrl` must be a valid fully-qualified URL."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "201 Created — Link resource",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "type", "value": "link", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "title", "value": "Khan Academy — Kinematics", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "externalUrl", "value": "https://www.khanacademy.org/science/physics", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"] }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"title\": \"Khan Academy \\u2014 Kinematics\",\n  \"description\": null,\n  \"fieldId\": null,\n  \"fileUrl\": null,\n  \"fileName\": null,\n  \"fileSize\": null,\n  \"mimeType\": null,\n  \"externalUrl\": \"https://www.khanacademy.org/science/physics/one-dimensional-motion\",\n  \"isProcessed\": false,\n  \"conversationIds\": [],\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:05:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:05:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "400 Bad Request — externalUrl missing",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{ "key": "type", "value": "link", "type": "text" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"] }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": \"External URL is required for link type resources\",\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "List Resources",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Has data array', () => pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array'));",
              "pm.test('Has pagination', () => pm.expect(body.pagination).to.have.all.keys('page','limit','total','totalPages'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources?page=1&limit=10",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "page", "value": "1", "description": "Page number. Min: 1. Default: 1." },
            { "key": "limit", "value": "10", "description": "Items per page. Min: 1, Max: 100. Default: 10." },
            { "key": "type", "value": "document", "description": "Filter by type: document | textbook | image | audio | video | link", "disabled": true },
            { "key": "fieldId", "value": "{{field_id}}", "description": "Filter by field UUID.", "disabled": true },
            { "key": "search", "value": "lecture", "description": "Case-insensitive search on title and description.", "disabled": true }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns a paginated list of the authenticated user's resources.\n\nAll query parameters are optional. `page` and `limit` default to `1` and `10` respectively. `limit` is capped at 100."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources?page=1&limit=10", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"type\": \"document\",\n      \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3\",\n      \"description\": \"Covers chapters 5\\u20137\",\n      \"fieldId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n      \"fileUrl\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/cognix/raw/upload/v1714900000/cognix/resources/1714900000-lecture-notes.pdf\",\n      \"fileName\": \"lecture-notes.pdf\",\n      \"fileSize\": 204800,\n      \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n      \"externalUrl\": null,\n      \"isProcessed\": false,\n      \"conversationIds\": [\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 10,\n    \"total\": 47,\n    \"totalPages\": 5\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Single Resource",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Correct id', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get('resource_id')));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Fetches a single resource by ID. Returns 404 if the resource does not exist or does not belong to the authenticated user."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"type\": \"document\",\n  \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3\",\n  \"description\": \"Covers chapters 5\\u20137\",\n  \"fieldId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"fileUrl\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/cognix/raw/upload/v1714900000/cognix/resources/1714900000-lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileName\": \"lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileSize\": 204800,\n  \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"externalUrl\": null,\n  \"isProcessed\": false,\n  \"conversationIds\": [\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"],\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "404 Not Found",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/non-existent-id", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "non-existent-id"] }
          },
          "status": "Not Found",
          "code": 404,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 404,\n  \"message\": \"Resource not found\",\n  \"error\": \"Not Found\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Resource",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Title updated', () => pm.expect(body.title).to.equal('Lecture Notes Week 3 (Revised)'));",
              "pm.test('ConversationIds updated', () => pm.expect(body.conversationIds).to.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('conversation_id')));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3 (Revised)\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated with exam tips\",\n  \"fieldId\": \"{{field_id}}\",\n  \"conversationIds\": [\"{{conversation_id}}\"]\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Updates resource metadata. All body fields are optional — only send what you want to change.\n\n**conversationIds behaviour:** Providing `conversationIds` replaces the entire set of tagged conversations. Send `\"conversationIds\": []` to untag all conversations. Omit `conversationIds` entirely to leave them unchanged. Every ID must be a conversation you own — otherwise a 400 lists the ones that didn't resolve.\n\nFile replacement is not supported via this endpoint."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3 (Revised)\",\n  \"conversationIds\": [\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"type\": \"document\",\n  \"title\": \"Lecture Notes Week 3 (Revised)\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated with exam tips\",\n  \"fieldId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"fileUrl\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/cognix/raw/upload/v1714900000/cognix/resources/1714900000-lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileName\": \"lecture-notes.pdf\",\n  \"fileSize\": 204800,\n  \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"externalUrl\": null,\n  \"isProcessed\": false,\n  \"conversationIds\": [\"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"],\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-11T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-11T11:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "400 Bad Request — Validation error",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"] }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": [\"title should not be empty\"],\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delete Resource",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Correct message', () => pm.expect(body.message).to.equal('Resource deleted successfully'));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('resource_id', '');",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Permanently deletes the resource record and removes the associated file from Cloudinary storage. This action is irreversible."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resources/{{resource_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "resources", "{{resource_id}}"] }
